<html>
<head>
<title>MikroTik Failover - Event Log</title>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Event Log</h1>
<p>This module displays all events recorded by the MikroTik Failover daemon.</p>
<h2>Columns</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Timestamp</b>: Date and time of the event</li>
<li><b>Trunk</b>: Name of the affected trunk</li>
<li><b>Event</b>: Type of event (UNREACHABLE, RECOVERY, etc.)</li>
<li><b>IP</b>: IP address of the trunk</li>
<li><b>Ping</b>: Result of the ping test</li>
<li><b>Action</b>: Action taken by the daemon</li>
<li><b>Status</b>: Result of the action</li>
</ul>
</body>
</html>
